sequenceDiagram
    participant API as GraphQL API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Relay as Outbox Relay
    participant Kafka as Kafka Broker
    
    API->>DB: wCTE (Task Created: Project A)
    API->>DB: wCTE (Task Deleted: Project B)
    API->>DB: wCTE (Task Updated: Project A)
    
    DB-->>Relay: pg_notify (Batch 1)
    
    Relay->>Kafka: Publish [Project A] -> Partition 0
    Relay->>Kafka: Publish [Project B] -> Partition 1
    Relay->>Kafka: Publish [Project A] -> Partition 0
    
    Note over Kafka: Partition 0 ensures strict<br/>causal ordering for Project A.
